1
00:01:52,480 --> 00:01:53,400
Coach,

2
00:01:53,760 --> 00:01:55,760
why is this road all uphill?

3
00:01:56,000 --> 00:01:57,000
It's exhausting.

4
00:01:58,480 --> 00:01:59,439
Without stamina,

5
00:01:59,439 --> 00:02:01,359
technique is useless.

6
00:02:01,640 --> 00:02:03,560
Xu Anbo, as a center,

7
00:02:03,879 --> 00:02:05,640
if you can't keep up with the guards,

8
00:02:05,640 --> 00:02:07,319
the whole team will fall apart.

9
00:02:10,879 --> 00:02:12,639
My road is quite fun.

10
00:02:12,639 --> 00:02:14,560
There are forests, streams,

11
00:02:14,560 --> 00:02:15,479
and waterfalls.

12
00:02:15,479 --> 00:02:18,120
It's like a jungle adventure.

13
00:02:20,360 --> 00:02:21,360
This route

14
00:02:21,639 --> 00:02:22,639
was personally chosen

15
00:02:22,639 --> 00:02:23,680
by Gu Chenyang.

16
00:02:24,240 --> 00:02:25,400
It's fun,

17
00:02:25,400 --> 00:02:26,719
but don't forget your mission.

18
00:02:29,120 --> 00:02:30,280
Just wait and see.

19
00:02:30,520 --> 00:02:32,360
Lin Qingyuan, full speed ahead.

20
00:02:37,439 --> 00:02:38,639
Li Haoyu,

21
00:02:38,639 --> 00:02:41,000
there's a big surprise on this route.

22
00:02:41,000 --> 00:02:42,680
I'm even jealous.

23
00:02:42,680 --> 00:02:43,719
You'll see.

24
00:02:49,560 --> 00:02:49,960
Hi.

25
00:02:51,280 --> 00:02:51,960
Li Haoyu.

26
00:02:54,080 --> 00:02:55,240
Your foot's still hurt?

27
00:02:56,080 --> 00:02:56,879
It's fine.

28
00:02:57,240 --> 00:02:57,960
Just a minor issue.

29
00:02:58,560 --> 00:02:59,199
By the way,

30
00:02:59,479 --> 00:03:00,639
what are you doing here?

31
00:03:00,639 --> 00:03:01,400
What's wrong?

32
00:03:02,639 --> 00:03:04,000
If you keep going up this path,

33
00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:04,680
you'll end up

34
00:03:05,039 --> 00:03:06,759
you'll end up at the scenic overlook.

35
00:03:09,800 --> 00:03:10,919
I thought for once,

36
00:03:10,919 --> 00:03:12,159
Gu Chenyang was actually nice,

37
00:03:12,159 --> 00:03:13,280
turns out he's been waiting here

38
00:03:25,240 --> 00:03:26,439
for minutes.

39
00:03:26,439 --> 00:03:27,639
Why isn't he moving?

40
00:03:38,199 --> 00:03:39,080
Lin Qingyuan!

41
00:03:41,120 --> 00:03:41,879
Lin Qingyuan!

42
00:03:43,719 --> 00:03:44,520
Lin Qingyuan!

43
00:03:47,080 --> 00:03:48,039
Water.

44
00:03:48,599 --> 00:03:49,960
You're rushing too fast at the start.

45
00:03:50,520 --> 00:03:51,879
This is orienteering.

46
00:03:51,879 --> 00:03:53,000
You need to have a plan.

47
00:03:53,560 --> 00:03:54,719
You can't just do it on a whim.

48
00:03:56,280 --> 00:03:57,080
Drink slowly.

49
00:03:57,439 --> 00:03:58,199
Hold it in your mouth.

50
00:04:02,319 --> 00:04:03,439
I'm alive again.

51
00:04:06,479 --> 00:04:08,000
I told you to drink slowly.

52
00:04:08,000 --> 00:04:09,159
You ran too fast.

53
00:04:09,159 --> 00:04:10,639
Your heart can't handle drinking so much.

54
00:04:10,639 --> 00:04:12,360
No, I just took a sip of water.

55
00:04:12,360 --> 00:04:13,439
Do you have to be like this?

56
00:04:13,439 --> 00:04:14,599
It's common sense.

57
00:04:15,599 --> 00:04:16,959
Common sense, common sense.

58
00:04:17,319 --> 00:04:18,839
Can you stop using your common sense

59
00:04:18,839 --> 00:04:20,360
and reason on me?

60
00:04:20,600 --> 00:04:21,879
My parents don't do this.

61
00:04:22,920 --> 00:04:24,560
I don't care about them.

62
00:04:24,800 --> 00:04:26,079
But as your captain,

63
00:04:26,079 --> 00:04:27,360
I have to be responsible for you.

64
00:04:28,319 --> 00:04:29,360
So annoying.

65
00:04:29,720 --> 00:04:30,920
You keep nagging.

66
00:04:30,920 --> 00:04:31,720
I told you

67
00:04:31,720 --> 00:04:32,879
don't bother me anymore.

68
00:04:33,279 --> 00:04:34,160
You are the one

69
00:04:34,160 --> 00:04:35,199
who is controlling.

70
00:04:35,600 --> 00:04:36,800
You are a control freak.

71
00:04:41,000 --> 00:04:42,199
Unreasonable.

72
00:04:43,839 --> 00:04:45,480
You are unreasonable.

73
00:04:46,720 --> 00:04:48,199
It's suffocating.

74
00:04:54,160 --> 00:04:55,360
This basketball club

75
00:04:55,680 --> 00:04:57,279
is really getting less and less fun.

76
00:04:57,959 --> 00:04:58,639
Boring.

77
00:05:07,879 --> 00:05:08,839
Be careful.

78
00:05:08,839 --> 00:05:09,399
OK.

79
00:05:20,560 --> 00:05:21,680
The scenery here is quite good.

80
00:05:22,279 --> 00:05:23,920
Let's take a break here.

81
00:05:23,920 --> 00:05:25,000
The sun is about to set.

82
00:05:25,240 --> 00:05:26,519
Aren't you afraid of not completing the task?

83
00:05:26,720 --> 00:05:27,480
There's still time.

84
00:05:28,920 --> 00:05:30,160
The road behind is quite difficult to walk on.

85
00:05:30,439 --> 00:05:31,079
Sit first.

86
00:05:35,040 --> 00:05:35,680
Sit.

87
00:06:01,839 --> 00:06:02,560
Are you coming or not?

88
00:06:32,399 --> 00:06:33,439
Actually,

89
00:06:34,360 --> 00:06:35,639
I've been very upset these days.

90
00:06:37,439 --> 00:06:38,720
Because of the video game?

91
00:06:40,720 --> 00:06:42,000
When it was there before,

92
00:06:42,959 --> 00:06:43,600
I didn't care.

93
00:06:44,519 --> 00:06:45,720
Now that it's broken,

94
00:06:46,759 --> 00:06:48,360
I still feel uncomfortable.

95
00:06:49,079 --> 00:06:49,920
It's quite upsetting.

96
00:06:55,680 --> 00:06:56,800
I know it's very important

97
00:06:56,800 --> 00:06:57,399
to you.

98
00:06:59,600 --> 00:07:00,680
It's a gift from my mom.

99
00:07:01,639 --> 00:07:03,279
I don't see her very often.

100
00:07:04,560 --> 00:07:05,600
I still play it from time to time.

101
00:07:05,600 --> 00:07:06,639
That game console

102
00:07:07,639 --> 00:07:08,439
makes me

103
00:07:09,240 --> 00:07:10,399
happier.

104
00:07:24,480 --> 00:07:25,759
You fixed it for me.

105
00:07:35,319 --> 00:07:36,839
How do you want me to fix it?

106
00:07:37,360 --> 00:07:38,399
I didn't hear you clearly.

107
00:07:38,720 --> 00:07:39,199
No.

108
00:07:39,199 --> 00:07:40,560
Why are you so quiet?

109
00:07:41,399 --> 00:07:42,319
Everyone is sleeping.

110
00:07:43,120 --> 00:07:44,279
I'm calling you

111
00:07:44,279 --> 00:07:45,120
downstairs in the dormitory.

112
00:07:46,920 --> 00:07:48,000
It's very difficult for me to guide you

113
00:07:48,000 --> 00:07:48,800
from such a distance.

114
00:07:49,240 --> 00:07:50,199
Why don't you mail it to me?

115
00:08:07,480 --> 00:08:08,639
You even care about this.

116
00:08:10,360 --> 00:08:11,199
What did you say?

117
00:08:11,680 --> 00:08:12,399
Nothing.

118
00:08:22,600 --> 00:08:23,279
By the way,

119
00:08:23,959 --> 00:08:24,600
why haven't I seen

120
00:08:24,600 --> 00:08:25,560
your mom around lately?

121
00:08:25,800 --> 00:08:26,560
I wanted to say hello

122
00:08:26,560 --> 00:08:27,360
to her.

123
00:08:28,920 --> 00:08:30,000
She's been busy,

124
00:08:30,800 --> 00:08:31,800
doesn't have much time.

125
00:08:34,120 --> 00:08:35,000
So have you been

126
00:08:35,000 --> 00:08:35,919
here these days?

127
00:08:39,000 --> 00:08:40,120
Maybe.

128
00:08:42,960 --> 00:08:43,600
Alright,

129
00:08:44,679 --> 00:08:45,480
when you're free,

130
00:08:45,480 --> 00:08:46,879
come by and see us.

131
00:08:49,559 --> 00:08:50,399
Maybe.

132
00:08:59,879 --> 00:09:00,559
Alright.

133
00:09:05,960 --> 00:09:06,559
Thank you.

134
00:09:09,320 --> 00:09:10,320
As long as you put your heart

135
00:09:11,080 --> 00:09:12,320
into it,

136
00:09:12,320 --> 00:09:13,639
you can fix anything.

137
00:09:14,360 --> 00:09:15,120
Thank you.

138
00:09:16,039 --> 00:09:16,879
It's okay.

139
00:09:26,399 --> 00:09:26,919
Alright.

140
00:09:27,679 --> 00:09:28,399
Time to go.

141
00:09:29,080 --> 00:09:29,399
Okay.

142
00:09:34,240 --> 00:09:34,919
Bye.

143
00:09:38,840 --> 00:09:39,679
Take care.

144
00:09:39,679 --> 00:09:40,519
Okay.

145
00:10:07,679 --> 00:10:08,519
What's wrong with your foot?

146
00:10:10,320 --> 00:10:11,000
It's nothing.

147
00:10:11,159 --> 00:10:12,600
I'll be fine after a rest.

148
00:10:12,840 --> 00:10:13,440
I have medicine here.

149
00:10:13,440 --> 00:10:14,360
I'll get it for you later.

150
00:10:14,720 --> 00:10:15,240
Okay.

151
00:10:17,240 --> 00:10:18,039
Where are the other two?

152
00:10:18,360 --> 00:10:19,120
Still waiting for two.

153
00:10:19,440 --> 00:10:20,399
I just called Xu Anbo.

154
00:10:20,399 --> 00:10:21,440
He said

155
00:10:21,440 --> 00:10:22,679
he'd be here soon.

156
00:10:22,679 --> 00:10:24,000
But Lin Qingyuan

157
00:10:26,679 --> 00:10:27,559
ran off

158
00:10:27,559 --> 00:10:28,600
at the beginning.

159
00:10:29,000 --> 00:10:29,879
He's not here yet?

160
00:10:30,759 --> 00:10:31,519
I'll call him

161
00:10:31,519 --> 00:10:32,200
call him.

162
00:10:32,440 --> 00:10:33,559
I've called several times,

163
00:10:33,559 --> 00:10:34,240
but no answer.

164
00:10:35,080 --> 00:10:36,960
And his shared location

165
00:10:37,559 --> 00:10:38,320
on the map app

166
00:10:38,320 --> 00:10:39,159
just disappeared.

167
00:10:39,639 --> 00:10:40,879
Maybe he's out of signal.

168
00:10:41,440 --> 00:10:42,159
His route

169
00:10:42,159 --> 00:10:43,559
has the best scenery,

170
00:10:43,559 --> 00:10:44,759
maybe he's still enjoying it.

171
00:10:55,279 --> 00:10:56,519
You look like you've been through hell.

172
00:10:56,759 --> 00:10:57,960
Don't even mention it.

173
00:10:58,240 --> 00:10:59,759
There was a big hole down there.

174
00:11:00,080 --> 00:11:01,240
Luckily, I reacted quickly.

175
00:11:01,600 --> 00:11:03,240
Otherwise, I would have fallen.

176
00:11:04,519 --> 00:11:05,919
That idiot Lin Qingyuan,

177
00:11:06,360 --> 00:11:07,720
did he fall into a pit too?

178
00:11:12,080 --> 00:11:13,159
Now that you mention it,

179
00:11:13,840 --> 00:11:14,840
I saw a bag

180
00:11:14,840 --> 00:11:15,720
on the roadside.

181
00:11:15,720 --> 00:11:16,879
It was just thrown there.

182
00:11:16,879 --> 00:11:17,879
Could it be his?

183
00:11:20,679 --> 00:11:21,799
Go find it now!

184
00:11:22,600 --> 00:11:23,200
You guys

185
00:11:23,440 --> 00:11:24,000
search over there.

186
00:11:24,000 --> 00:11:24,799
I'll check the surveillance.

187
00:11:24,799 --> 00:11:25,159
Okay.

188
00:11:25,159 --> 00:11:25,600
Okay, coach.

189
00:11:25,600 --> 00:11:25,879
Okay.

190
00:11:32,120 --> 00:11:38,200
Lin Qingyuan!

191
00:11:39,240 --> 00:11:40,679
Lin Qingyuan!

192
00:11:41,399 --> 00:11:43,039
Lin Qingyuan!

193
00:11:51,919 --> 00:11:53,159
Where did she go?

194
00:11:53,279 --> 00:11:54,759
Lin Qingyuan!

195
00:12:09,559 --> 00:12:10,519
Lin Qingyuan!

196
00:12:13,440 --> 00:12:14,000
Gu Chenyang,

197
00:12:14,000 --> 00:12:14,919
what are you doing here?

198
00:12:14,919 --> 00:12:16,240
Why did you turn off your phone?

199
00:12:16,240 --> 00:12:16,679
Do you know

200
00:12:16,679 --> 00:12:17,519
everyone is worried about you?

201
00:12:17,519 --> 00:12:18,519
Everyone is looking for you!

202
00:12:18,919 --> 00:12:20,600
Ouch, let go of me first.

203
00:12:24,159 --> 00:12:24,960
My phone's dead.

204
00:12:24,960 --> 00:12:25,960
I didn't mean to.

205
00:12:25,960 --> 00:12:26,679
Out of power?

206
00:12:27,120 --> 00:12:28,200
Are you a three-year-old?

207
00:12:28,200 --> 00:12:29,679
You should check the battery before going out.

208
00:12:29,679 --> 00:12:31,360
And you should go up the mountain when it's out of power.

209
00:12:31,360 --> 00:12:32,519
Why are you yelling?

210
00:12:32,519 --> 00:12:33,679
I'm fine here.

211
00:12:33,679 --> 00:12:34,759
Fine?

212
00:12:34,759 --> 00:12:36,080
It's getting dark.

213
00:12:36,080 --> 00:12:36,559
Who knows

214
00:12:36,559 --> 00:12:37,519
happen later?

215
00:12:37,919 --> 00:12:38,759
What will happen?

216
00:12:39,039 --> 00:12:39,840
None of your business.

217
00:12:39,840 --> 00:12:40,679
Lin Qingyuan.

218
00:12:40,960 --> 00:12:42,200
Lin Qingyuan.

219
00:12:44,879 --> 00:12:46,200
Thank goodness, you're okay.

220
00:12:46,960 --> 00:12:48,759
Why are you two arguing again?

221
00:12:51,000 --> 00:12:52,240
I joined the basketball club

222
00:12:52,240 --> 00:12:53,279
to play basketball

223
00:12:53,279 --> 00:12:54,240
and have fun,

224
00:12:54,240 --> 00:12:55,159
not to listen to you

225
00:12:55,159 --> 00:12:55,960
talk about

226
00:12:55,960 --> 00:12:56,559
mountain running training every day.

227
00:12:56,559 --> 00:12:57,879
You're just digging holes here by yourself.

228
00:12:57,879 --> 00:12:59,320
What does that have to do with basketball?

229
00:12:59,320 --> 00:13:00,039
That's for...

230
00:13:02,600 --> 00:13:04,120
Forget it. It's pointless.

231
00:13:04,720 --> 00:13:05,440
Instead of

232
00:13:05,440 --> 00:13:06,360
being here every day

233
00:13:06,360 --> 00:13:07,200
and being scolded by you,

234
00:13:07,799 --> 00:13:08,799
causing them to worry,

235
00:13:09,320 --> 00:13:10,320
I'll just quit.

236
00:13:10,600 --> 00:13:10,919
Lin Qingyuan!

237
00:13:10,919 --> 00:13:11,799
Wait, Lin Qingyuan!

238
00:13:12,279 --> 00:13:13,559
You're just angry.

239
00:13:13,559 --> 00:13:14,600
Don't say anything you'll regret.

240
00:13:15,360 --> 00:13:16,840
We're a team.

241
00:13:17,440 --> 00:13:18,559
I'm not angry.

242
00:13:21,399 --> 00:13:22,480
Captain,

243
00:13:23,159 --> 00:13:23,720
I...

244
00:13:24,320 --> 00:13:25,360
Lin Qingyuan

245
00:13:27,320 --> 00:13:28,159
decided to quit.

246
00:13:29,879 --> 00:13:30,519
Wait.

247
00:13:30,519 --> 00:13:31,919
Why didn't you tell me you found her?

248
00:13:31,919 --> 00:13:33,240
I've been looking for her for a long time.

249
00:13:35,639 --> 00:13:36,639
What's going on?

250
00:13:38,840 --> 00:13:40,039
I'm going to quit the club.

251
00:13:41,879 --> 00:13:42,840
Whatever.

252
00:14:08,240 --> 00:14:09,279
Thank you, doctor.

253
00:14:41,919 --> 00:14:42,879
Fu Binyan

254
00:14:43,559 --> 00:14:44,480
You come just in time.

255
00:14:44,879 --> 00:14:45,799
I have an important message

256
00:14:45,799 --> 00:14:46,639
to tell you.

257
00:14:47,080 --> 00:14:48,000
I don't want to hear it.

258
00:14:49,679 --> 00:14:50,799
I quit the Basketball Club.

259
00:14:56,240 --> 00:14:57,240
I thought it through.

260
00:14:58,600 --> 00:14:59,399
I'm not the kind of person

261
00:14:59,399 --> 00:15:00,399
who sticks to the end.

262
00:15:00,639 --> 00:15:01,879
There's no need to be unhappy

263
00:15:02,600 --> 00:15:04,120
and get angry in the Basketball Club.

264
00:15:07,559 --> 00:15:09,559
Look at Gu Chenyang.

265
00:15:09,799 --> 00:15:11,080
Can't he speak nicely?

266
00:15:11,279 --> 00:15:12,480
He always

267
00:15:12,480 --> 00:15:14,000
lectures people with a poker face.

268
00:15:17,440 --> 00:15:18,879
I'm so angry.

269
00:15:20,000 --> 00:15:22,039
He's not the only one with a temper.

270
00:15:23,480 --> 00:15:24,879
I really can't stand it.

271
00:15:30,159 --> 00:15:30,919
Su,

272
00:15:31,639 --> 00:15:32,799
do you have nothing else

273
00:15:33,120 --> 00:15:34,600
to say but "hmm"?

274
00:15:35,399 --> 00:15:36,679
I told you I don't want to hear it.

275
00:15:37,200 --> 00:15:38,440
You insisted on telling me.

276
00:15:38,840 --> 00:15:39,799
Besides,

277
00:15:39,799 --> 00:15:40,840
what do you want me to say?

278
00:15:41,519 --> 00:15:42,679
Tell you not to leave?

279
00:15:43,320 --> 00:15:43,759
to stay.

280
00:15:43,799 --> 00:15:44,120
Just...

281
00:15:45,120 --> 00:15:46,279
You can support me.

282
00:15:48,320 --> 00:15:48,919
Fine.

283
00:15:49,360 --> 00:15:50,039
I support you.

284
00:15:50,440 --> 00:15:51,039
Really.

285
00:15:52,399 --> 00:15:53,879
I told Zhou Yang long ago

286
00:15:54,200 --> 00:15:55,360
that your team

287
00:15:55,960 --> 00:15:57,039
has no skills,

288
00:15:57,639 --> 00:15:58,720
no heart,

289
00:15:59,080 --> 00:16:00,200
and no chance.

290
00:16:01,480 --> 00:16:02,480
A team like that

291
00:16:02,559 --> 00:16:03,600
can't possibly win.

292
00:16:04,360 --> 00:16:05,840
There's nothing worth staying for.

293
00:16:09,159 --> 00:16:09,960
Senior,

294
00:16:10,519 --> 00:16:12,039
we're not that bad.

295
00:16:15,200 --> 00:16:16,279
Anyway,

296
00:16:16,279 --> 00:16:17,399
Gu Chenyang is not bad.

297
00:16:18,639 --> 00:16:19,480
He

298
00:16:20,720 --> 00:16:21,679
is okay in terms of skills,

299
00:16:22,360 --> 00:16:23,440
but not good enough to be a captain.

300
00:16:25,320 --> 00:16:26,360
What do you mean?

301
00:16:27,679 --> 00:16:29,240
A player like you

302
00:16:29,240 --> 00:16:31,279
who shirks at the first sign of trouble

303
00:16:31,879 --> 00:16:33,440
isn't cut out for basketball.

304
00:16:33,440 --> 00:16:34,120
What...

305
00:16:34,120 --> 00:16:34,919
He didn't

306
00:16:36,240 --> 00:16:37,519
kick you out,

307
00:16:38,080 --> 00:16:39,440
but spent all his effort

308
00:16:39,440 --> 00:16:40,799
preparing training plans for you.

309
00:16:41,480 --> 00:16:43,240
Can you count on a captain

310
00:16:43,240 --> 00:16:44,159
who works hard for nothing?

311
00:16:48,279 --> 00:16:49,080
That's why I'm backing you up.

312
00:16:49,679 --> 00:16:50,519
Go.

313
00:16:51,639 --> 00:16:52,159
Xue.

314
00:17:36,839 --> 00:17:38,000
What are you doing here alone?

315
00:17:39,519 --> 00:17:40,279
Sandwich.

316
00:17:40,640 --> 00:17:41,759
With extra meat.

317
00:17:42,519 --> 00:17:43,119
Not hungry?

318
00:17:45,680 --> 00:17:47,000
Then check this out.

319
00:17:47,440 --> 00:17:48,240
Take a look.

320
00:17:50,200 --> 00:17:51,279
This is...

321
00:17:51,279 --> 00:17:52,359
Your favorite.

322
00:17:53,279 --> 00:17:55,039
What's it called, stag beetle?

323
00:17:55,640 --> 00:17:57,279
Lin Qingyuan left it here yesterday.

324
00:17:58,720 --> 00:18:00,000
He didn't make it to the summit

325
00:18:00,279 --> 00:18:01,680
because he saw this.

326
00:18:03,720 --> 00:18:04,359
He said you two

327
00:18:04,359 --> 00:18:05,559
had a fight before,

328
00:18:06,119 --> 00:18:07,359
and he wanted to give this to you

329
00:18:07,759 --> 00:18:08,960
to make up.

330
00:18:12,480 --> 00:18:13,720
He scratched his hand

331
00:18:13,720 --> 00:18:14,920
trying to catch it.

332
00:18:19,039 --> 00:18:19,720
Mountain running training,

333
00:18:19,720 --> 00:18:21,079
and you're here digging holes in trees?

334
00:18:21,079 --> 00:18:22,400
What's the connection with basketball?

335
00:18:22,400 --> 00:18:23,160
That's for...

336
00:18:24,160 --> 00:18:25,680
Forget it. It's not worth it.

337
00:18:31,839 --> 00:18:33,160
He's really naive.

338
00:18:34,279 --> 00:18:35,400
So what if he's naive?

339
00:18:36,519 --> 00:18:37,440
Unlike you,

340
00:18:37,440 --> 00:18:38,480
like an old man,

341
00:18:38,799 --> 00:18:40,000
just like your dad.

342
00:18:43,079 --> 00:18:44,200
Don't get upset.

343
00:18:45,400 --> 00:18:46,519
I just think

344
00:18:47,039 --> 00:18:48,400
there's no need for everyone to be the same.

345
00:18:49,480 --> 00:18:50,799
We have different personalities,

346
00:18:51,440 --> 00:18:52,839
but we can come together.

347
00:18:53,799 --> 00:18:55,240
Don't you think it's cool?

348
00:19:00,240 --> 00:19:01,400
You promised me that

349
00:19:01,799 --> 00:19:03,319
as long as the basketball club is established,

350
00:19:03,640 --> 00:19:05,039
you would meet three of my conditions.

351
00:19:05,279 --> 00:19:06,440
Now I'm going to use one of them.

352
00:19:06,880 --> 00:19:07,799
What?

353
00:19:08,599 --> 00:19:09,319
Promise me

354
00:19:09,720 --> 00:19:10,799
you won't be mad at him.

355
00:19:11,240 --> 00:19:12,160
We're all friends.

356
00:19:14,000 --> 00:19:15,000
Then you've wasted it.

357
00:19:15,319 --> 00:19:16,240
I'm not angry.

358
00:19:25,359 --> 00:19:26,079
Gu Chenyang,

359
00:19:26,400 --> 00:19:27,480
I want to challenge you.

360
00:19:27,880 --> 00:19:29,839
See you at the basketball court.

361
00:19:32,799 --> 00:19:34,319
There's going to be a good show.

362
00:20:08,440 --> 00:20:09,759
I accept your challenge.

363
00:20:10,160 --> 00:20:10,920
But the rules

364
00:20:11,319 --> 00:20:12,119
are set by me.

365
00:20:12,440 --> 00:20:12,960
Fine.

366
00:20:13,319 --> 00:20:14,119
How do you want to play?

367
00:20:14,440 --> 00:20:15,880
Three-point spot shooting.

368
00:20:15,880 --> 00:20:16,759
Five spots.

369
00:20:17,039 --> 00:20:18,119
Start at the same time.

370
00:20:18,119 --> 00:20:19,440
Two-minute limit.

371
00:20:20,400 --> 00:20:21,640
I'll step back half a meter.

372
00:20:21,640 --> 00:20:23,119
You shoot as per the standard.

373
00:20:23,119 --> 00:20:24,640
As long as you score more than me,

374
00:20:24,640 --> 00:20:25,599
you win.

375
00:20:26,839 --> 00:20:27,480
Okay.

376
00:21:19,119 --> 00:21:19,839
Okay.

377
00:21:21,960 --> 00:21:22,839
[This feeling]

378
00:21:23,640 --> 00:21:24,599
is back.

379
00:22:10,839 --> 00:22:11,880
Ten seconds left.

380
00:22:12,039 --> 00:22:13,599
Both sides have only one ball left.

381
00:22:13,759 --> 00:22:16,079
Gu Chenyang is leading 13 to 12.

382
00:22:16,440 --> 00:22:17,240
Come on!

383
00:22:50,799 --> 00:22:51,759
Game over.

384
00:22:51,839 --> 00:22:53,240
Both sides have 13 balls.

385
00:22:53,319 --> 00:22:53,799
It's a tie.

386
00:22:59,920 --> 00:23:00,839
I really did it.

387
00:23:00,960 --> 00:23:02,319
I knew you could do it.

388
00:23:02,799 --> 00:23:03,519
Awesome, bro!

389
00:23:03,680 --> 00:23:04,880
You're a hidden gem!

390
00:23:05,119 --> 00:23:05,920
This is incredible!

391
00:23:06,279 --> 00:23:06,960
Congratulations!

392
00:23:18,160 --> 00:23:19,079
Gu Chenyang,

393
00:23:19,079 --> 00:23:20,240
your training plan

394
00:23:20,680 --> 00:23:21,680
actually worked!

395
00:23:23,480 --> 00:23:24,920
That's just part of it.

396
00:23:26,359 --> 00:23:27,440
What really worked

397
00:23:27,880 --> 00:23:29,000
was your perseverance.

398
00:23:30,519 --> 00:23:31,319
Perseverance?

399
00:23:34,119 --> 00:23:35,960
Yes, perseverance.

400
00:23:38,759 --> 00:23:39,240
Captain,

401
00:23:39,799 --> 00:23:40,599
I won't leave.

402
00:23:41,160 --> 00:23:41,640
From now on,

403
00:23:42,039 --> 00:23:43,119
I will keep going.

404
00:23:52,519 --> 00:23:53,759
That's more like it.

405
00:23:53,759 --> 00:23:54,440
Yeah, that's more like it.

406
00:23:54,440 --> 00:23:55,480
The Yibei Basketball Club

407
00:23:55,480 --> 00:23:57,279
can't be without anyone.

408
00:23:59,279 --> 00:24:00,319
Lift him up.

409
00:24:00,319 --> 00:24:01,119
Three, two, one.

410
00:24:02,960 --> 00:24:04,119
Three, two, one.

411
00:24:06,200 --> 00:24:07,440
Three, two, one.

412
00:24:11,440 --> 00:24:12,559
Three, two, one.

413
00:24:14,359 --> 00:24:15,319
Three, two, one.

414
00:24:17,599 --> 00:24:18,680
Three, two, one.

415
00:24:20,160 --> 00:24:21,279
Three, two, one.

416
00:24:23,279 --> 00:24:24,279
Still not had enough fun?

417
00:24:24,799 --> 00:24:25,480
Let's do it again.

418
00:24:25,839 --> 00:24:26,799
No, no, no.

419
00:24:26,880 --> 00:24:27,400
No more.

420
00:24:27,400 --> 00:24:28,039
Alright.

421
00:25:36,680 --> 00:25:37,279
Come on!

422
00:25:37,480 --> 00:25:38,079
Good!

423
00:26:06,680 --> 00:26:07,880
Nice shot!

424
00:26:08,039 --> 00:26:09,920
Lin Qingyuan, nice shot!
